# Master Geographic Map V1 full-resolution validation artifacts (regenerable; ~35 MB of PNGs).
# Regenerate with: node scripts/world/run.mjs /scripts/world/renderMasterMap.ts docs/world/master-map-v1
# Only docs/world/master-map-v1/previews/ (small JPEGs) and stats.json are committed.
/docs/world/master-map-v1/*.png
